<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5212] Allow custom affinity for system caches</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5212</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently there is no option to specify affinity function atomics system cache, which may be not appropriate in custom data placement scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Suggestion: allow setting custom affinity for AtomicConfiguration&lt;/p&gt;</description>
